    "text": {
      "en": "Scan a raft for white. Common Scoter is all black with a yellow-orange bill knob and no white at all. Velvet Scoter is bigger and has a white wing patch, with a small white mark by the eye. Surf Scoter has white patches on the forehead and nape, and a bill with white, orange and black."
